  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-21" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:4.11pt"&gt;Item 12 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Effective January 19, 2026, Tim Ubel was elected Vice President &amp;amp; Assistant Treasurer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; Effective February 1, 2026, John D. Porter was promoted from Senior Vice President to Executive Vice President.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Effective February 13, 2026, Robin F. Shilt retired from the company as Vice President and Assistant Treasurer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Effective February 21, 2026, Perrin J. Boone was elected as Vice President.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Effective February 21, 2026, Payvand Fazel was promoted from Vice President to Senior Vice President.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Effective February 21, 2026, Glen G. Jasek was promoted from Vice President to Senior Vice President.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="f-22" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.11pt"&gt;Item 13 N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfInterimDisclosureTextBlock id="f-23" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:0.45pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;These interim financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements and accompanying notes contained in Form 2 of MountainWest Overthrust Pipeline, LLC for the year ended December 31, 2025. Although unaudited, management believes these financial statements include all normal recurring adjustments necessary for a fair presentation of the financial position, results of operations, and cash flows for the period presented. The results for this interim period are not necessarily indicative of the results expected for the full year. Certain information and notes that would substantially duplicate the disclosures in the most recent FERC Form 2 have been omitted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfInterimDisclosureTextBlock>
