            <td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-left:1pt solid #000;border-right:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:115%">Schedule Page: 102 Line No.: 2 Column: a</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:19pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Overthrust is indirectly owned by the MountainWest Pipelines Holding Company which is in turn 100% owned by The WIlliams Companies, Inc</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:19pt">
        <table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:98.900%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-left:1pt solid #000;border-right:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:115%">Schedule Page: 114 Line No.: 2 Column: c</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">In 2026, Total Reported Operating Revenues of $23.7 Million includes $7.3 Million attributable to Leased Transportation capacity that is not part of Overthrust's system pursuant to 119 FERC &#182; 61,069, at P 40 (2007).</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"></span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">In addition, approximately 21% of Overthrust&#8217;s overall costs are allocable to the Leased Transportation capacity.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:19pt">
