      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Inventory in account 164.1 represents the balance of pipeline owned gas which the pipeline intends to sell or transport. Pipeline owned gas is reported under the inventory method.</span>
