      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Of the total reported volumes, 6,573,397 Dth is attributable to Leased Capacity.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
