            <td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-left:1pt solid #000;border-right:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:115%">Schedule Page: 358 Line No.: 24 Column: (d)</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Common systems hardware and software costs are allocated via general allocations using "Modified Massachusetts" formula (MMF).</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
